        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:IVAs">IV As</ref> 6.2a</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">⁊ gif he ealderman oððe abbud oþþe ðegen sece, hæbbe ðeora nihta fyrst.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">If he flees to an ealdorman, or an abbot or a thegn, he shall have a respite of three days.</ab>
